{
  "tema": 5218,
  "slug": "estuve-preterito-estar",
  "titulo": "Estar in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Estuve dos horas en la línea.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Estar is irregular in the preterite: estuve, estuviste, estuvo, estuvimos, estuvieron. The stem is estuv- and none of the forms has a written accent.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Estar** uses the irregular stem **estuv-** plus special endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "estar"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**estuve**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**estuviste**"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**estuvo**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "**estuvimos**"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ustedes",
              "**estuvieron**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **estuve**, **estuvo** (not estuvé, estuvó). The stress falls on **-tu-**: es**TU**ve, es**TU**vo."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use it for a stay or state with a **clear beginning and end**: **estuve dos horas en la línea**, **estuvimos en Ensenada el fin de semana**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For background (_I was tired, it was sunny_) Spanish usually uses the imperfect **estaba**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **estuv-** sounds like a _stove_: you were there, then you left."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Estuve== dos horas en la línea para cruzar.",
              "en": "I spent two hours in line to cross the border."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Dónde ==estuviste== anoche?",
              "en": "Where were you last night?"
            },
            {
              "es": "La fiesta ==estuvo== muy buena.",
              "en": "The party was really good."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estuvimos== en Ensenada todo el fin de semana.",
              "en": "We were in Ensenada all weekend."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis papás ==estuvieron== en Oaxaca en diciembre.",
              "en": "My parents were in Oaxaca in December."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estuve== enfermo toda la semana pasada.",
              "en": "I was sick all last week."
            },
            {
              "es": "El mar ==estuvo== picado toda la mañana.",
              "en": "The sea was choppy all morning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
